    "title_en": "Theoretical Review of Critical Point Predictions",
    "abstract_en": "This review summarizes recent theoretical progress on the QCD equation of state near the critical point and developments in the maximum entropy freeze-out framework, which provides a systematic connection between hydrodynamic fluctuations and hadronic multiplicity cumulants. We also discuss recent applications of this framework, together with advances in the dynamical evolution of critical fluctuations.",
